Approval prompts
Allow the docs MCP server to run tool "save"? Environment: env-a.
Allow the docs MCP server to run tool "save"? Environment: env-b.

Scenario: Two computers expose config-backed docs and plugin-backed notes; tools, resources, approvals, and reviews use their owning computer. Identical resource URIs stay unchanged and require an environment to select one.

